# before labelling: a "verification" asked before an e-transfer, its kind not named,
# -> etransfer-send (the step is part of sending); a named kind also gets its own
# topic (2FA or approval -> two-step-verification, ID or selfie -> trusted-device).
# A forgotten-password reset is not change-password-pin -> O.
